    },
    {
      "resource_id": "BIA-01957",
      "source_text": "Hartsock: He loved being in the thick of it.  Every time I turned around in Normandy he'd been knocked out by artillery or a mortar or some damn thing.",
      "ko": "하트삭: 그 녀석은 한복판에 뛰어드는 걸 좋아했습니다. 노르망디에선 돌아볼 때마다 포격이든 박격포든 뭐든 맞고 쓰러져 있었죠.",
      "source_tokens": [],
      "ko_tokens": [],
      "token_ok": true,
      "pipe_count_ok": true,
      "ko_utf8_bytes": 174,
      "max_bytes": ""
    },
    {
      "resource_id": "BIA-01959",
      "source_text": "Hartsock: He somehow managed to reach HQ on the radio.  They sent the tanks.",
