      "pipe_count_ok": true,
      "ko_utf8_bytes": 36,
      "max_bytes": ""
    },
    {
      "resource_id": "BIA-02011",
      "source_text": "Hartsock: Still got miles to go before we rest, sir.",
      "ko": "하트삭: 쉬려면 아직 갈 길이 멉니다.",
      "source_tokens": [],
      "ko_tokens": [],
      "token_ok": true,
      "pipe_count_ok": true,
      "ko_utf8_bytes": 49,
      "max_bytes": ""
    },
    {
      "resource_id": "BIA-02012",
      "source_text": "Hartsock: That boy could talk.",
      "ko": "하트삭: 그 녀석은 정말 말이 많았어.",
      "source_tokens": [],
      "ko_tokens": [],
      "token_ok": true,
      "pipe_count_ok": true,
      "ko_utf8_bytes": 49,
      "max_bytes": ""
    },
    {
      "resource_id": "BIA-02014",
      "source_text": "Hartsock: That was five days ago.",
      "ko": "하트삭: 닷새 전 일이야.",
      "source_tokens": [],
      "ko_tokens": [],
      "token_ok": true,
      "pipe_count_ok": true,
      "ko_utf8_bytes": 32,
      "max_bytes": ""
    },
    {
      "resource_id": "BIA-02015",
      "source_text": "Hartsock: That's not what happened.",
      "ko": "하트삭: 실제로는 그렇지 않았습니다.",
      "source_tokens": [],
      "ko_tokens": [],
      "token_ok": true,
      "pipe_count_ok": true,
      "ko_utf8_bytes": 50,
      "max_bytes": ""
    },
    {
      "resource_id": "BIA-02016",
      "source_text": "Hartsock: There was one person who was going to get me home safely to my family.",
      "ko": "하트삭: 제 가족에게 무사히 돌아가게 해 줄 사람이 딱 한 명 있다고 생각했습니다.",
