      "pipe_count_ok": true,
      "ko_utf8_bytes": 87,
      "max_bytes": ""
    },
    {
      "resource_id": "BIA-02291",
      "source_text": "Marshall: And Sgt. Baker?",
      "ko": "마셜: 그럼 베이커 병장은?",
      "source_tokens": [],
      "ko_tokens": [],
      "token_ok": true,
      "pipe_count_ok": true,
      "ko_utf8_bytes": 35,
      "max_bytes": ""
    },
    {
      "resource_id": "BIA-02293",
      "source_text": "Marshall: And your first objective as a Sergeant was taking St. Sauveur?",
      "ko": "마셜: 병장이 된 뒤 첫 목표가 생소뵈르 점령이었나?",
      "source_tokens": [],
      "ko_tokens": [],
      "token_ok": true,
      "pipe_count_ok": true,
      "ko_utf8_bytes": 69,
      "max_bytes": ""
    },
    {
      "resource_id": "BIA-02294",
      "source_text": "Marshall: At ease, Sergeant.  Have a seat.",
      "ko": "마셜: 편히 있게, 병장. 앉게.",
      "source_tokens": [],
      "ko_tokens": [],
      "token_ok": true,
      "pipe_count_ok": true,
      "ko_utf8_bytes": 38,
      "max_bytes": ""
    },
    {
      "resource_id": "BIA-02295",
      "source_text": "Marshall: Baker got quite a scar.  Is yours from that battle too?",
      "ko": "마셜: 베이커에게도 큰 흉터가 생겼지. 자네 것도 그 전투에서 생긴 건가?",
