      "ko_tokens": [],
      "token_ok": true,
      "pipe_count_ok": true,
      "ko_utf8_bytes": 97,
      "max_bytes": ""
    },
    {
      "resource_id": "BIA-02296",
      "source_text": "Marshall: Changed your mind?",
      "ko": "마셜: 생각을 바꿨다고?",
      "source_tokens": [],
      "ko_tokens": [],
      "token_ok": true,
      "pipe_count_ok": true,
      "ko_utf8_bytes": 31,
      "max_bytes": ""
    },
    {
      "resource_id": "BIA-02297",
      "source_text": "Marshall: Everything you said is important, a lot of good we can learn from this.",
      "ko": "마셜: 자네가 한 말은 모두 중요하네. 여기서 배울 게 많아.",
      "source_tokens": [],
      "ko_tokens": [],
      "token_ok": true,
      "pipe_count_ok": true,
      "ko_utf8_bytes": 78,
      "max_bytes": ""
    },
    {
      "resource_id": "BIA-02299",
      "source_text": "Marshall: Excuse me, Sergeant?",
      "ko": "마셜: 뭐라고 했나, 병장?",
      "source_tokens": [],
      "ko_tokens": [],
      "token_ok": true,
      "pipe_count_ok": true,
      "ko_utf8_bytes": 33,
      "max_bytes": ""
    },
    {
      "resource_id": "BIA-02300",
      "source_text": "Marshall: How did the drop go?",
      "ko": "마셜: 강하는 어땠나?",
      "source_tokens": [],
      "ko_tokens": [],
      "token_ok": true,
      "pipe_count_ok": true,
      "ko_utf8_bytes": 28,
      "max_bytes": ""
    },
    {
      "resource_id": "BIA-02303",
      "source_text": "Marshall: I can't confirm that.  I thought Pvt. Leggett's radio wasn't working.",
      "ko": "마셜: 그건 확인할 수 없네. 레겟 이병의 무전기는 작동하지 않았던 걸로 알고 있는데.",
      "source_tokens": [],
      "ko_tokens": [],
      "token_ok": true,
      "pipe_count_ok": true,
      "ko_utf8_bytes": 114,
      "max_bytes": ""
    },
    {
      "resource_id": "BIA-02304",
      "source_text": "Marshall: I think that's all the questions I have.",
      "ko": "마셜: 질문은 이 정도면 된 것 같네.",
      "source_tokens": [],
      "ko_tokens": [],
      "token_ok": true,
      "pipe_count_ok": true,
      "ko_utf8_bytes": 47,
      "max_bytes": ""
    },
    {
